<title>MOROCCO: Veteran Moroccan musician Fouiteh dies.</title>
<headline>Veteran Moroccan musician Fouiteh dies.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Popular Moroccan musician and veteran artist Mohamed Fouiteh died in the northern city of Tangier at the age of 67, the Moroccan official news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fouiteh suffered from a head illness, it said but gave no details.</p>
</text>
